451699.overview:
A Polish-language educational game series focusing on learning and testing in the field of mathematics, this installment created by Witold Gantzke and Mariusz Prusiewski and published by Mikrozet in 1994. 

SET 4 contains programs in the field of mathematics of grade 5 of primary school: 
Calculating the percentage of a number; 
Percentage calculations part 1; 
What percentage a given number is; 
Percentage calculations part 2 :
Two programs teach all the skills related to percentage calculations available to the minds of fifth-grade students. After thoroughly explaining the skills developed on several examples, the student takes the TEST. 

Completing the TEST by a student means that the appropriate skill has been well mastered. The other two programs allow the student to apply the acquired skills to solve several simple tasks with attractive content.
